# SPA fallback for the public station mini sites.
#
# The app uses hash routing, so `/#/site/<slug>` needs no host support. The
# clean path `/site/<slug>` does, and on Cloudflare Pages the actual mechanism
# is `functions/site/[[path]].ts` — this project ignores `_redirects` rules
# (verified: both `/site/*` and a wholesale `/*` rule still returned the static
# 404 page). The rule is kept because it is correct, harmless, and covers any
# host that does honour the file.
#
# 200 (not 301) so the address bar keeps the clean URL.
/site/*  /index.html  200
